<h3 style="color: #111827; margin: 40px 0 20px 0;">Pro Tips for Success</h3>

<ul class="features-list">
    <li><strong>Complete your profile</strong> - Profiles with photos get 5x more views</li>
    <li><strong>Be specific</strong> - Clearly define what you offer in your gig descriptions</li>
    <li><strong>Set fair prices</strong> - Start competitive and adjust as you build reviews</li>
    <li><strong>Respond quickly</strong> - Fast responses lead to more orders</li>
    <li><strong>Deliver quality</strong> - Great work leads to repeat clients and referrals</li>
</ul>

